<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady/$0.50 up - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady/$0.50 up - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady-$0.50 higher. Demand moderate. Top $58.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 57.50-58.00, some 58.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs. 56.50-57.50</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 1.00 higher. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-500 lbs. 42.00-46.00,few 47.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 45.00-48.00,few 49.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs. 47.00-48.00,few 49.00-50.00</p>
</text>
